{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00018.png?t=1741612101\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00017.png?t=1741612101\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BIRDS. EVERYWHERE. AND THEY\u2019RE IN YOUR HEAD!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're out-numbered, out-flapped, and totally ticked off! And these pesky vermin are using MIND TRICKS to throw you off!\u00a0 But lucky you - a not so\u00a0<i>close, close </i>friend lent you a ROCKET SHIP!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ignore distractions, blast those squawkers, and show \u2018em WHO\u2019S BOSS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00019.png?t=1741612101\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00021.png?t=1741612101\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAJOR RICHARD JOHNSON - SOLDIER OF FORTUNE TURNED MASTER BUILDER!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At <strong>RETROA RETROA</strong>, the agency so good they named it twice, he crafts high-stakes training simulations. But he\u2019s drowning in unfinished levels!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission?</strong> Jump in, test his wild creations, and help him clear the backlog! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time to BUILD. Time to CONQUER. Be a RETROA RETROA BUILDA!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00022.png?t=1741612101\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421880/extras/vlcsnap-00023.png?t=1741612101\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE SLIMES TRUST YOU\u2026 BUT THEY CAN NEVER KNOW.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019re trapped, desperate to escape, they dream of freedom. - but the dungeon level's never end. They must NEVER know.\u00a0Drop blocks, guide them upward, and <strong>never</strong> let them lose hope! The more lives you have, the harder it gets. One left? Easy\u2026 until one mistake <strong>seals their fate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help them climb. Help them believe. Even if they\u2019ll never leave.</strong>\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Have you made the right choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2421880/acda1d83a8174baa7905f2a8c8ff57146ec079ef.jpg"},{"name":"Patience of a saint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2421880/ef706f04a1d7436231fa72b830266ad8afc0bb11.jpg"},{"name":"Patience is not your virtue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2421880/79563988c6af01ea3384f2551b1326aa55ab821f.jpg"},{"name":"That took me by surprise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2421880/0387f69a3baa6f7532cccc4c201a9f3c49718e66.jpg"},{"name":"High flyer","path":"https://cdn.akam